      authorityClaim: 'source-narrative',
      normalizedStatement:
        '2. **Ideation is mutual.** For Pantheon under a verified, active OM-PAN-001 grant, apply `docs/standing-mandates/OM-PAN-001.md`; this exception does not apply to other goals or create Runtime authority. Within that mandate, the coordinator records routine refinements and uses DA001 for concrete non-destructive amendments; destructive or undelegated changes hold for the owner. Outside that scoped mandate: The coordinator proposes; the developer disposes. Open design questions are surfaced as explicit numbered decisions with a recommendation each - never silently resolved. (The four-decision ratification that created this document is the reference example.)',
